# The wgpu headers build every descriptor with a WGPU_*_INIT macro that casts a
# literal zero into enums which have no zero enumerator, and wgpu-native extends
# WGPUSType with values the base enum does not declare. Both are how the API is
# meant to be used, so the two checks that report every descriptor are off here.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-invalid-enum-default-initialization,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
